  "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>과학의 날 대회로 내맘대로 롤링볼을 해봤습니다.</p>\r\n<p>시골학교라서 과학교사가 저 혼자입니다..ㅠㅠ</p>\r\n<p>만들기 쉬운재료라고 해서 동아 사이언스몰에서 구입해서 조별로 만들어보라고 했습니다. </p>\r\n<p>일단 과제 완성한 것을 영상으로 촬영해봤는데요..</p>\r\n<p>평가기준안을 만들기가 쉽지가 않네요..</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>종(점1), 물레방아(1점), 원운동(2점), 계단(2점), 점프(1점), 소재변경(1점)으로 해서 점수를 합산하여 시상하려 합니다. </p>\r\n<p>더 좋은 아이디어 있으면 댓글 부탁드려요...</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"v98710Ok709ci7T7Hm9cQOQ\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v98710Ok709ci7T7Hm9cQOQ?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY5ODcxME9rNzA5Y2k3VDdIbTljUU9RIiwidGlkIjoiMzNhNWRhOGYtMWJhMi00M2E5LTk5MjEtM2RhZDYzZThiYWJmIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTkyMDk5fQ.7Nn-cbsZ0rt7SRcCgAY4n3i_MEJK-9NWRVorqUloMclSiaHmKjPbyr35JaUYyeX3duv2w2WRCNXV4Iuu8e4pag&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"v363eUGhp94X9ZpZiGYYZ6G\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v363eUGhp94X9ZpZiGYYZ6G?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InYzNjNlVUdocDk0WDlacFppR1lZWjZHIiwidGlkIjoiMWYyMDlkM2ItNThhOC00ZGI5LWE0ZDUtNTNhMzA4ZTkzZjg0IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTkyMDk5fQ.QGKw3zxhVMrsby4tkb0rEWxjVUmSrd4Aj_hjLMrvHdYBHIedtg2gDCOcXi2HhYjq6yWMAoi_i9iMTHB0CHSnqQ&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"v32b03ZTggidwQrQ3ZThTip\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v32b03ZTggidwQrQ3ZThTip?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InYzMmIwM1pUZ2dpZHdRclEzWlRoVGlwIiwidGlkIjoiMDlkY2JkNGMtYTRlNC00OWI4LWI0Y2EtMDhmMjk1NWU0ZTAzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTkyMDk5fQ.BTXBjyeH5fkR2OV3WawV8cQuktK6cpnIV3UhO6yyWedL4I3b6HTrDYz1mORPSBZRNdP9Dn9yZVfZgnoPT